t  say she should probably get some  counseling and maybe visit a doctor  Marguerite isn't happy to have you in  her section of the Baker compound and  we'll let you know as up gloss and  personally as she can the next one is a  fascinating fright aunt Rhody a  wheelchair-bound old-age pensioner with  zero ability to move somehow pops up all  around the mansion to home her potential  Christmas number one  [Music]  creepy as hell she hasn't moved during  our play through but we all know come  January 24th she'll scare us to death  finally psv our PlayStation virtual  reality will take horror to another  level if you don't believe me find that  one friend we all have who lives with  their parents in the late 20s usually  and can afford V our luxuries try the  demo in virtual reality and then order  re 7 online and maybe pick up a box of  deluxe adult diapers too those were the  nine scariest things we've seen so far  during our time with resident evil 7 are  you convinced by the change in direction  for the series and will you be picking  it up please let us know below also do  is a favor please and press subscribe as  we really need your support i'm adam  from playstation grenade i'll see you  next time

